@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8001

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"new.customer@example.com","password":"Password1","full_name":"New Customer","phone":"9000000010"}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=customer@food.test&password=Customer123!

### Search restaurants
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants?city=Chennai&page=1&size=20&sort=name

